---
title: "Housing"
layout: layouts/ffBase.njk
permalink: /shrines/finalfantasyxiv/housing/
description: "Aggro Phobic's FFXIV housing scrapbook — giant mushrooms, pink trees, winding paths and an overgrown little garden."
customcss: "/assets/css/ffxiv/housing.css"
---

{% set h = ffxivHousing %}

<div class="ff-housing">
  <section class="ff-house-hero ff-card">
    <div class="ff-house-hero__image">
      {% if h.home.image %}
        <img src="{{ h.home.image }}" alt="{{ h.home.alt or h.home.name }}">
      {% else %}
        <div class="ff-house-photo-placeholder ff-house-photo-placeholder--hero">
          <span>⌂</span>
          <strong>wide home screenshot</strong>
          <small>your best overall room / exterior shot</small>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ff-house-hero__label">
        <small>✦ Aggro’s home ✦</small>
        <strong>{{ h.home.name }}</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-house-hero__copy">
      <p class="ff-house-kicker">⌂ little corner of Eorzea</p>
      <h1>Housing</h1>
      <p class="ff-house-location">{{ h.home.location }}</p>
      <p>{{ h.home.intro }}</p>

      <div class="ff-house-tags">
        {% for tag in h.home.tags %}
          <span>{{ tag }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <p class="ff-house-privacy">
        ♡ mostly here for the garden, honestly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-house-favourite ff-card">
    <div class="ff-house-favourite__copy">
      <p class="ff-house-kicker">♡ currently obsessed with</p>
      <h2>{{ h.favouriteCorner.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ h.favouriteCorner.caption }}</p>
      <span class="ff-house-handwritten">the mushroom corner wins every time ♡</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-house-favourite__image">
      {% if h.favouriteCorner.image %}
        <img src="{{ h.favouriteCorner.image }}" alt="{{ h.favouriteCorner.alt or h.favouriteCorner.title }}">
      {% else %}
        <div class="ff-house-photo-placeholder ff-house-photo-placeholder--favourite">
          <span>✦</span>
          <small>favourite corner screenshot</small>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-house-tour ff-card">
    <div class="ff-house-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="ff-house-kicker">✦ come have a nose around</p>
        <h2>Around the garden</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Eight little views of the outside — the paths, plants and odd corners that make the plot feel like Aggro’s rather than a showroom.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-house-tour-grid">
      {% for room in h.rooms %}
        <figure class="ff-house-room{% if loop.index == 1 or loop.index == 4 %} ff-house-room--wide{% endif %}">
          <div class="ff-house-room__image">
            {% if room.image %}
              <img src="{{ room.image }}" alt="{{ room.alt or room.title }}">
            {% else %}
              <div class="ff-house-photo-placeholder">
                <span>⌂</span>
                <small>{{ room.title }}</small>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          <figcaption>
            <strong>{{ room.title }}</strong>
            <p>{{ room.caption }}</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ff-house-two-col">
    <section class="ff-house-things ff-card">
      <div class="ff-house-section-head ff-house-section-head--compact">
        <div>
          <p class="ff-house-kicker">♡ tiny favourites</p>
          <h2>The garden personality</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ff-house-things-grid">
        {% for item in h.favouriteThings %}
          <article>
            <span class="ff-house-things__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ item.icon }}</span>
            <div>
              <small>{{ item.label }}</small>
              <strong>{{ item.name }}</strong>
              <p>{{ item.note }}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="ff-house-project ff-card">
      <span class="ff-house-project__pin" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
      <p class="ff-house-kicker">currently</p>
      <h2>{{ h.currentProject.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ h.currentProject.text }}</p>

      <div class="ff-house-project__list">
        {% for tag in h.currentProject.tags %}
          <span>{{ tag }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <p class="ff-house-handwritten">a tidy garden would be suspicious ♡</p>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="ff-house-crosslink ff-card">
    <div class="ff-house-crosslink__mini">
      <span aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
      <div>
        <small>Aggro lately</small>
        <strong>homebody, but make it fashionable</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-house-crosslink__copy">
      <p class="ff-house-kicker">✧ wardrobe next door</p>
      <h2>Now pick an outfit for the garden</h2>
      <p>The glamour page is the other scrapbook half: favourite looks, repeated pieces and whatever Aggro is wearing lately.</p>
    </div>

    <a class="ff-button ff-button--primary" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/glams/">Open the wardrobe →</a>
  </section>
</div>
